sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion Service
    participant Kafka as Event Broker
    participant Geospatial as Geospatial Service
    participant RiskCatalog as Risk Catalog Service
    participant RiskEvaluation as Risk Evaluation Service
    participant Orchestrator as Alert Orchestrator
    participant Channels as Alert Delivery

    %% 1. Sensor envia dados
    Sensor->>Ingestion: RegistrarColetaSensor / RegistrarEventoNatural
    Note right of Ingestion: Normaliza, valida e publica evento
    Ingestion->>Kafka: SensorEventDetected

    %% 2. Eventos chegam ao processamento
    Kafka->>Geospatial: SensorEventDetected
    Kafka->>RiskEvaluation: SensorEventDetected
    Kafka->>RiskCatalog: (opcional) atualização de catálogo

    %% 3. Geospatial processa contexto espacial
    Geospatial->>Kafka: RegionIntersected
    Kafka->>Orchestrator: RegionIntersected

    %% 4. Risk Evaluation calcula risco
    RiskCatalog->>Kafka: RiskCatalogPublished
    Kafka->>RiskEvaluation: RiskCatalogPublished
    RiskEvaluation->>Geospatial: GetSpatialContext
    RiskEvaluation->>Kafka: RiskUpdated / RiskEvaluated / HighRiskDetected
    Kafka->>Orchestrator: RiskUpdated

    %% 5. Orquestrador avalia e dispara alerta
    Orchestrator->>Channels: TriggerAlert
    Channels->>Orchestrator: AlertConfirmed
